JAVA GITHUB COURSE PROJECT
----------------------------------
DESCRIPTION
This project is a fork of a pre-existing github repository which consists of three distinct java programs with their own operations and usages

PROJECT USE
The project consists of a Calculator, Weather and Greeting class:
- Weather will inform the user whether the inputed temperature is hot,cold or mid
- Calculator will either add or subtract two values and return the new value
- Greeting will greet the user when run

CONTRIBUTION
The project is still undergoing changes, please feel free to use and update. 

BUG FIXES
- Calculator had the subtract methods operation changed, (+) -> (-)
- Greeting had it's greeting word changed from "Goodbye" to "Hello"
- Weather had it's return labels swapped for accuracy
